entries[435802] = { ["name"] = "Wave of Souls", ["text"] = "100 yd range\nInstant\nReaper's Mark sends forth bursts of Shadowfrost energy and back, dealing [ Blood : (84.0937% of Attack Power) /\n\nFrost\n(96.7079% of Attack Power) ] Shadowfrost damage both ways to all enemies caught in its path.\n\nWave of Souls critical strikes cause enemies to take 5% increased Shadowfrost damage for 15 sec, stacking up to 2 times, and it is always a critical strike on its way back." }
