entries[435821] = { ["name"] = "Luredrop", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nA carnivorous plant found within the underground spaces of Khaz Algar; Luredrop uses small bioluminescent lights to draw in insects and other prey that it uses to thrive.\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
entries[435822] = { ["name"] = "Orbinid", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nKhaz Algar is a host to many unique species of plants, and Orbinid is no different. This plant seems to absorb latent magic through its viscous orb, which can be utilized in various professions to make anything from salves to inks.\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
entries[435823] = { ["name"] = "Blessing Blossom", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nThe Blessing Blossoms of Khaz Algar may appear harmless at first glance, but be wary: they host a dangerous toxin that can leave you extremely ill.\n\nHowever, if properly prepared, Blessing Blossoms have numerous medicinal properties, and drinking tea served in their hoods is considered a delicacy.\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
