entries[435826] = { ["name"] = "Arathor's Spear", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nFound within the bright, outdoor spaces of Khaz Algar, Arathor's Spear is a hearty herb with numerous uses.\n\nMost noteworthy is that the fibers can be woven to make parchment, or when tightly packed and treated, a material akin to wood.\n\nThis allows it to be used for anything from books, to bows, to staves.\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
entries[435829] = { ["name"] = "Lush Luredrop", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nA carnivorous plant found within the underground spaces of Khaz Algar; Luredrop uses small bioluminescent lights to draw in insects and other prey that it uses to thrive.\n\nSome herbs grow particularly well and thrive for any number of reasons, regardless of climate or location. Herbalists who come across these rare nodes can retrieve additional usable materials.\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
