entries[435836] = { ["name"] = "Lush Arathor's Spear", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nFound within the bright, outdoor spaces of Khaz Algar, Arathor's Spear is a hearty herb with numerous uses.\n\nMost noteworthy is that the fibers can be woven to make parchment, or when tightly packed and treated, a material akin to wood.\n\nThis allows it to be used for anything from books, to bows, to staves.\n\nSome herbs grow particularly well and thrive for any number of reasons, regardless of climate or location. Herbalists who come across these rare nodes can retrieve additional usable materials.\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
entries[435838] = { ["name"] = "Crystallized Mycobloom", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nMycobloom is an extremely common fungus found on Khaz Algar. It can be found in practically any terrain, growing absolutely anywhere it can.\n\nDue to their proximity to the Coreway, some herbs have a more direct connection with the World Soul. This link has caused the herbs to partially crystallize. Any herbalist who happens to gather one of these herbs will gain a small blessing in addition to some Crystalline Powder.\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
entries[435840] = { ["name"] = "Altered Mycobloom", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nMycobloom is an extremely common fungus found on Khaz Algar. It can be found in practically any terrain, growing absolutely anywhere it can.\n\nDeep below the surface of Khaz Algar lies the Black Blood of the Old Gods. It has begun to pool, and its festering has had an adverse affect on the local flora. Herbs that have had the misfortune of growing near such an influence have become altered... more dangerous. Any herbalist who braves the depths to gather such a thing will have to deal with the dangers of the plant itself, but will gain Writhing Samples for their efforts.\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
entries[435843] = { ["name"] = "Irradiated Mycobloom", ["text"] = "5 yd range\n2.5 sec cast\nMycobloom is an extremely common fungus found on Khaz Algar. It can be found in practically any terrain, growing absolutely anywhere it can.\n\nRecent events have led to a large amount of arcane magic to leak into the soil of Khaz Algar. As was noted back on the Dragon Isles, flora tend to be susceptible to magical influences, and this situation is no different.\n\nSome herbs here have become irradiated with arcane energy, and gathering them will allow the herbalist to obtain some Leyline Residue for their troubles. What may happen with the unstable arcane energy that remains however, is another story...\nDiscovery:\nFound somewhere on Khaz Algar" }
